{"id": "69205", "title": "清浅流年", "author": "盏茶", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 41, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69205.htm", "intro": "苏浅青，人如其名，外表恬静安然，清秀佳人一枚，眉宇间尽是温美。为爱所伤的她却有着不为人知的心痛回忆。\r\n五年后，那个骄傲俊逸却又伤她极深的人带着一身的光华重新出现在她的面前。\r\n与此同时，另一位曾久驻苏浅青心房的男子也巧合般地与她重逢。\r\n有爱有恨，有笑有泪，起承转合，缘起缘灭。\r\n这里，有悲伤，但，更有温情。\r\n清浅流年，我很庆幸，遇见了你，爱上了你。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69205", "chapters": [{"title": "留白", "file": "10587248.html", "available": false}, {"title": "即墨", "file": "10587249.html", "available": false}, {"title": "故人", "file": "10587250.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我很好，谢谢", "file": "10587251.html", "available": false}, {"title": "她与他", "file": "10587252.html", "available": false}, {"title": "失控", "file": "10587253.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情动", "file": "10587254.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外 林漠南的执着", "file": "10587255.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外 苏扬的感伤", "file": "10587256.html", "available": false}, {"title": "搬家", "file": "10587257.html", "available": false}, {"title": "庆功宴", "file": "10587258.html", "available": false}, {"title": "促膝长谈", "file": "10587259.html", "available": false}, {"title": "泡吧", "file": "10587260.html", "available": false}, {"title": "聚会", "file": "10587261.html", "available": false}, {"title": "践行", "file": "10587262.html", "available": false}, {"title": "苏少", "file": "10587263.html", "available": false}, {"title": "party", "file": "10587264.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我们都变了", "file": "10587265.html", "available": false}, {"title": "往昔", "file": "10587266.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十一假期", "file": "10587267.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外 有一种距离，叫做时间", "file": "10587268.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外 决意幸福", "file": "10587269.html", "available": false}, {"title": "相识", "file": "10587270.html", "available": false}, {"title": "她们", "file": "10587271.html", "available": false}, {"title": "败给现实", "file": "10587272.html"